' Common.abp - コマンド行・メモリ・書式の共通処理
' WinAPI 定数 (MAX_PATH / NULL 等) はホストヘッダまたは abc 組み込みを使う

Function GetCmd(cnt As Long, buf As *Byte) As Long
    Dim cmd As *Byte
    Dim cmdlen As Long
    Dim cidx As Long
    Dim ctmp[MAX_PATH] As Byte
    Dim n As Long
    Dim m As Long
    Dim pBuf As *Byte

    pBuf = buf
    cmd = GetCommandLine()
    cmdlen = lstrlen(cmd)
    cmd[cmdlen] = CH_SP
    pBuf[0] = 0
    cidx = 0

    For n = 0 To cmdlen
        If cmd[n] = CH_SP And cmd[n + 1] = CH_SP Then
            memcpy(VarPtr(cmd[n]), VarPtr(cmd[n + 1]), cmdlen - n)
            n = n - 1
            cmdlen = cmdlen - 1
        End If
    Next

    For n = 0 To cmdlen
        m = 0
        While cmd[n] <> CH_SP
            ctmp[m] = cmd[n]
            m = m + 1
            n = n + 1
        Wend
        ctmp[m] = 0
        If cidx = cnt Then
            lstrcpy(buf, ctmp)
            GetCmd = 1
            Exit Function
        End If
        cidx = cidx + 1
    Next
    GetCmd = 0
End Function

Sub ZeroMem(p As *Byte, n As Long)
    Dim i As Long
    Dim q As *Byte
    If n <= 0 Then Exit Sub
    q = p
    For i = 0 To n - 1
        q[i] = 0
    Next
End Sub

Function HexPad$(num As Long, digits As Long) As String
    Dim s As String
    s = Hex$(num)
    While Len(s) < digits
        s = "0" + s
    Wend
    HexPad$ = s
End Function
